
Direct 1-to-1 Mapping

Spring Boot
@PostMapping("/users")
public User createUser(@RequestBody User user) {
    return userService.save(user);
}

Gin
func CreateUser(c *gin.Context) {
	var user models.User
	c.ShouldBindJSON(&user)
}


✔ Same purpose
✔ Same behavior
✔ Same responsibility

🧠 What ShouldBindJSON actually does

Behind the scenes, Gin:

Reads request body

Parses JSON

Maps JSON → struct fields

Runs validation (if tags exist)

Returns error if invalid

Equivalent to:

HttpMessageConverter + Jackson
